        "quiz_id": 2164,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "In schools and universities, girls tend to choose arts while boys like science.  What are the reasons for this trend? Do you think this tendency should be changed?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WoB3dBfXFoACLxxNAowlEpm4gaf\"><em><strong>In schools and universities, girls tend to choose arts while boys like science. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UUQjdgw5coDBkKxl8QblE1bygac\"><em><strong>What are the reasons for this trend? Do you think this tendency should be changed?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Gender and Subject Choice</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWapdIXG0oVm4Tx6hKhlXvjggof\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Gender and Subject Choice&nbsp;n&oacute;i về xu hướng <strong>(trend / tendency)</strong> nam sinh thường chọn khoa học tự nhi&ecirc;n <strong>(science)</strong> c&ograve;n nữ sinh thường chọn nghệ thuật <strong>(arts)</strong> ở trường học v&agrave; đại học. Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n của xu hướng n&agrave;y v&agrave; n&ecirc;u &yacute; kiến liệu n&ecirc;n thay đổi xu hướng n&agrave;y hay kh&ocirc;ng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jh56dP31yosnctxL985lNBIZg13\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề th&uacute; vị về sự kh&aacute;c biệt giới t&iacute;nh <strong>(gender differences)</strong> trong việc lựa chọn ng&agrave;nh học. C&oacute; nhiều &yacute; kiến cho rằng sự kh&aacute;c biệt n&agrave;y l&agrave; do năng khiếu bẩm sinh <strong>(innate talent)</strong>, trong khi số kh&aacute;c cho rằng đ&oacute; l&agrave; do ảnh hưởng của x&atilde; hội v&agrave; định kiến giới <strong>(gender stereotypes)</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KgGvdgcCRoty3TxID2tlQsUpgVu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nq58dEv0aoLfQfxnVxzljGZSgrb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7ChdHlEaoM8bdxKxxol0ThEgXg\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn c&oacute; thể ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ở BODY 1 v&agrave; n&ecirc;u quan điểm về việc c&oacute; n&ecirc;n thay đổi xu hướng n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng ở BODY 2.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UInmd7hp5oFavYx0bYclaahCgbc\">\n<ul>\n<li>Ở BODY 1, m&igrave;nh sẽ ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch 2 nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh: năng lực của từng giới <strong>(gender-specific competency)</strong> v&agrave; thị trường lao động <strong>(labour market)</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mrs1dIhzioHx6wx49EwllC6vggf\">\n<ul>\n<li>Ở BODY 2, m&igrave;nh sẽ n&ecirc;u quan điểm l&agrave; n&ecirc;n thay đổi xu hướng n&agrave;y v&igrave; n&oacute; hạn chế tiềm năng của mỗi c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng tốt cho x&atilde; hội.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GgAMd32deowSSXxbidHlnh8kgrh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URMsdmFWNo3ySSx94iRlkubQgWh\">M&igrave;nh sẽ ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch 2 nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh dẫn đến xu hướng nam sinh chọn khoa học, nữ sinh chọn nghệ thuật.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjwsdZuy8ofgzrxfPzellF03gcb\">Cấu tr&uacute;c: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting Idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&oacute; hai nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh dẫn đến xu hướng n&agrave;y l&agrave; năng lực bẩm sinh <strong>(innate talent) </strong>của mỗi giới v&agrave; thị trường lao động <strong>(labour market)</strong>.</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">Năng lực của từng giới <strong>(gender-specific competency)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; ➜ Nam giới c&oacute; xu hướng ph&aacute;t triển n&atilde;o tr&aacute;i <strong>(left brain)</strong> tốt hơn</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;➜ giỏi kĩ năng tư duy ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch <strong>(analytical reasoning skills)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;➜ ph&ugrave; hợp với c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n khoa học.</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; ➜ Ngược lại, nữ giới thường ph&aacute;t triển n&atilde;o phải <strong>(right brain)</strong> tốt hơn</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;➜ gi&uacute;p ph&aacute;t triển khả năng nghệ thuật v&agrave; biểu đạt <strong>(artistic and expressive)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;➜ ph&ugrave; hợp với c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n nghệ thuật.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fpbid38iGoJVcixLqJwla8eBg3b\">Thị trường lao động <strong>(labour market)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fpbid38iGoJVcixLqJwla8eBg3b\">&nbsp; ➜ C&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng th&iacute; nghiệm <strong>(laboratories)</strong> thường ưu ti&ecirc;n tuyển dụng ứng vi&ecirc;n nam (<strong>male candidates</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fpbid38iGoJVcixLqJwla8eBg3b\">&nbsp; ➜ Điều n&agrave;y l&agrave;m nản l&ograve;ng <strong>(discourage)</strong> nhiều nữ sinh</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fpbid38iGoJVcixLqJwla8eBg3b\">&nbsp; ➜ Khiến họ kh&ocirc;ng muốn theo đuổi c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh khoa học đ&ograve;i hỏi cao (<strong>highly demanding</strong>) nhưng cơ hội nghề nghiệp thấp (<strong>low in career prospects</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jo9cdHYcooaKCQxdDaTlbws2gHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OgnEdA845olSKzxnIbmlYENBguM\">M&igrave;nh sẽ n&ecirc;u quan điểm l&agrave; n&ecirc;n thay đổi xu hướng n&agrave;y v&agrave; đưa ra l&yacute; do.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wky2dHwOHog0glxP8cClwPWYgGd\">Cấu tr&uacute;c: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting Idea 2</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wky2dHwOHog0glxP8cClwPWYgGd\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LRnCdiSnfoqhVaxOuValDrQcgzc\">T&igrave;nh trạng n&agrave;y n&ecirc;n được giải quyết (<strong>be addressed</strong>) trong tương lai gần.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-N45idXDdIoIGpwxoKNUlF9u3gGd\">Mặc d&ugrave; mỗi giới c&oacute; thể c&oacute; năng khiếu ri&ecirc;ng, nhưng c&oacute; nhiều v&iacute; dụ về người th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng (<strong>thrive</strong>) bất chấp r&agrave;o cản <strong>(potential obstacles)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-N45idXDdIoIGpwxoKNUlF9u3gGd\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: Marie Curie - nh&agrave; khoa học nữ ph&aacute;t hiện ra nguy&ecirc;n tố Radium (<strong>the element Radium</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-N45idXDdIoIGpwxoKNUlF9u3gGd\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: Pablo Picasso - họa sĩ nam, một trong những họa sĩ vĩ đại nhất (<strong>one of the greatest artists</strong>) thế kỷ 20</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HYfLdXi8kochOhxyjmKl7qKbgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch&iacute;nh phủ n&ecirc;n c&oacute; biện ph&aacute;p x&oacute;a bỏ ph&acirc;n biệt đối xử giới t&iacute;nh <strong>(eliminate gender discrimination)</strong>&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HYfLdXi8kochOhxyjmKl7qKbgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ gi&uacute;p sinh vi&ecirc;n tự do lựa chọn ng&agrave;nh học họ th&iacute;ch <strong>(preferred disciplines)</strong>&nbsp;m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng lo lắng về việc l&agrave;m</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HYfLdXi8kochOhxyjmKl7qKbgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ sống cuộc sống trọn vẹn hơn <strong>(live life to the fullest)</strong></div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HYfLdXi8kochOhxyjmKl7qKbgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ tối ưu h&oacute;a đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;p cho lực lượng lao động <strong>(optimize contribution to the labour force)</strong>.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 65,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3gsdrJxKosFYmxExvrlcdaOgre\">It is common these days that male students prefer sciences, while their female counterparts often choose arts. <strong>There are several factors leading to this trend, and in my opinion, it should be discouraged, for the best interests of both each individual and society.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12865,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 66,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ch6tdDRXyomjY6xTDiClA7Ppghc\"><strong>The main reasons for this trend may be attributed to gender-specific competency and the labour market. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">With regard to the former, each gender seems to have a tendency to develop a certain part of their brain that suits their respective chosen fields. Scientific studies have repeatedly demonstrated that males have a more developed left brain, which facilitates analytical reasoning skills, while the opposite is true for females, whose artistic and expressive right brain hemispheres are usually dominant. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">In addition to that, the labour market seems to be another factor contributing to this phenomenon. It is unfortunately typical for laboratories, at least in my home country of Vietnam, to prefer male candidates when recruiting. This certainly discourages a portion of female students from entering such areas, which is highly demanding yet low in career prospects.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12865,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 67,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S4tidcdoToa900xmP4JlE8msgoh\"><strong>However, I believe this situation should be addressed in the near future.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Even though each gender may tend to have their own talent in a certain area, there is a wide range of examples of people who have thrived despite potential obstacles. One of them is Marie Curie, a female scientist who discovered the element Radium; or the painter Pablo Picasso, one of the greatest artists of the 20th century.<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">As a result of these observations, the government should take steps to eliminate gender discrimination in business, so that students will in turn be free to choose their preferred disciplines without worrying about being employed. This will enable each individual to live their life to the fullest, as well as optimize their contribution to the labour force.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12865,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 68,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AaZOdQkO5o8xqmxsaIZl7pdugAH\">In conclusion, the innate talent of each gender, compounded with the bias of recruiters could be the main reason for the unequal distribution of the two sexes in science and arts subjects. In my opinion, the authorities should take measures to tackle the situation for the good of both students and the whole community.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12865,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
